        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rolf de Heer, Joseph M. Newman, George Raft, Coleen Gray, Enzo Staiola\n- Works: The Tracker, I'll Get You for This, This Island Earth, Lucky Nick Cain\n- Roles: film directors, writer, actors\n- Topics: Dutch Australian film, American film, British thriller film\n\nFacts:\n- Rolf de Heer was born on 4 May 1951 and is a Dutch Australian film director.\n- Joseph M. Newman was born on August 17, 1909, died on January 23, 2006, and was an American film director.\n- In 1951, I'll Get You for This was released in the United States as Lucky Nick Cain.\n- I'll Get You for This is a 1951 British thriller film by Joseph M. Newman.\n- I'll Get You for This stars George Raft, Coleen Gray, and Enzo Staiola.\n- Joseph M. Newman was most famous for his 1955 film This Island Earth.\n- The Tracker was directed and written by Rolf de Heer.",
